# DejaGNU site configuration for LoongArch testing with QEMU.
#
# This file is passed to runtest via the DEJAGNU environment variable.
# It tells DejaGNU where to find the board description file
# (loongarch-sim.exp), which lives in the same directory as this file.
#
# Using [info script] keeps the path relocatable.

set boards_dir [file dirname [info script]]
